392
00:17:40,523 --> 00:17:42,274
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have the car keys
in my pocket,</font>

393
00:17:42,315 --> 00:17:45,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">you stupid…
bitch!</font>

394
00:17:49,399 --> 00:17:51,232
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm worried about Dad.</font>

395
00:17:51,274 --> 00:17:52,565
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where did he go now?</font>

396
00:17:52,606 --> 00:17:54,481
<font color="#FFFFFF">He said something
about Orientals,</font>

397
00:17:54,523 --> 00:17:56,149
<font color="#FFFFFF">then went to find
a toothpick.</font>

398
00:17:56,190 --> 00:17:57,440
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad?</font>

399
00:17:57,481 --> 00:17:58,773
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad?</font>

400
00:17:58,815 --> 00:17:59,982
<font color="#FFFFFF">Papa?</font>

401
00:18:00,023 --> 00:18:01,523
<font color="#FFFFFF">Help! Children!</font>

402
00:18:01,565 --> 00:18:03,523
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've lost my equilibrium!</font>

403
00:18:03,565 --> 00:18:05,023
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad, are you okay?</font>

404
00:18:05,065 --> 00:18:06,815
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thank you for
helping an old man.</font>

405
00:18:06,857 --> 00:18:08,023
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now this!</font>

406
00:18:08,065 --> 00:18:09,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ow!</font>

407
00:18:09,232 --> 00:18:10,982
<font color="#FFFFFF">What are you doing?</font>

408
00:18:11,023 --> 00:18:12,731
<font color="#FFFFFF">Killing you before you kill me!</font>

409
00:18:15,023 --> 00:18:16,815
<font color="#FFFFFF">No one's trying
to kill you.</font>

410
00:18:16,857 --> 00:18:18,107
<font color="#FFFFFF">You have dementia.</font>

411
00:18:18,149 --> 00:18:19,149
<font color="#FFFFFF">Crab apples.</font>

412
00:18:33,815 --> 00:18:36,315
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, God!</font>

413
00:18:39,149 --> 00:18:40,606
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm almost at the top.</font>

414
00:18:44,357 --> 00:18:46,565
<font color="#FFFFFF">I did it.</font>

415
00:18:46,606 --> 00:18:47,940
<font color="#FFFFFF">I reached the top.</font>

416
00:18:47,982 --> 00:18:49,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">Make me young again.</font>

417
00:18:51,315 --> 00:18:52,523
<font color="#FFFFFF">What the heck?</font>

418
00:18:52,565 --> 00:18:53,648
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, no!</font>

419
00:18:53,690 --> 00:18:55,481
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh! Ow! Aw!</font>

420
00:18:55,523 --> 00:18:57,399
<font color="#FFFFFF">Help!</font>

421
00:19:07,648 --> 00:19:09,315
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ow! Still?</font>

422
00:19:09,357 --> 00:19:10,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">Really?</font>

423
00:19:10,731 --> 00:19:12,399
<font color="#FFFFFF">Still falling.</font>

424
00:19:31,982 --> 00:19:34,274
<font color="#FFFFFF">Good boy.</font>

425
00:19:34,315 --> 00:19:36,440
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, my God.
Are you okay?</font>

426
00:19:36,481 --> 00:19:38,357
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. I didn't break the hex.</font>

427
00:19:38,399 --> 00:19:39,648
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm still old.</font>

428
00:19:39,690 --> 00:19:41,398
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's an understatement.</font>

429
00:19:41,399 --> 00:19:42,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're ancient.</font>

430
00:19:42,731 --> 00:19:44,065
<font color="#FFFFFF">What are you
even doing out here,</font>

431
00:19:44,107 --> 00:19:46,274
<font color="#FFFFFF">junking up the mountain
with your old bones.</font>

432
00:19:46,315 --> 00:19:47,648
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey.</font>

433
00:19:47,690 --> 00:19:49,399
<font color="#FFFFFF">You should be
at home, man,</font>

434
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:52,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">sitting on a super-padded
toilet seat, right, right,</font>

435
00:19:52,232 --> 00:19:54,107
<font color="#FFFFFF">farting out your
soup, uh-huh,</font>

436
00:19:54,149 --> 00:19:57,274
<font color="#FFFFFF">while your gross yellow toenails
click on the linoleum.</font>

437
00:19:57,315 --> 00:19:58,606
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's not very nice.</font>

438
00:19:58,648 --> 00:19:59,857
<font color="#FFFFFF">Or fair.</font>

439
00:19:59,898 --> 00:20:01,232
<font color="#FFFFFF">I just climbed that mountain.</font>

440
00:20:01,274 --> 00:20:03,065
<font color="#FFFFFF">Did you really climb it?</font>

441
00:20:03,107 --> 00:20:05,731
<font color="#FFFFFF">Or are you just having
another "senior moment"?</font>

442
00:20:05,773 --> 00:20:08,773
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, listen,
I used to think like you, too,</font>

443
00:20:08,815 --> 00:20:10,399
<font color="#FFFFFF">but I was wrong.</font>

444
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:12,898
<font color="#FFFFFF">I accomplished a big dream
of mine today,</font>

445
00:20:12,940 --> 00:20:15,274
<font color="#FFFFFF">and I did it as an old man.</font>

446
00:20:15,315 --> 00:20:17,606
<font color="#FFFFFF">I admit it,
it's not fun being old,</font>

447
00:20:17,648 --> 00:20:20,648
<font color="#FFFFFF">but we can still live rich,
productive lives.</font>

448
00:20:22,481 --> 00:20:24,940
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dude, you're dying, you're
going to Heaven right now.</font>

449
00:20:24,982 --> 00:20:26,481
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, if you see my grandma,</font>

450
00:20:26,523 --> 00:20:29,481
<font color="#FFFFFF">ask her why her breath
was so nasty.</font>

451
00:20:29,523 --> 00:20:32,773
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, I'm not dying.
I broke the hex!</font>

452
00:20:32,815 --> 00:20:37,107
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your elder abuse made me realize
how it truly feels to be old.</font>

453
00:20:37,149 --> 00:20:40,357
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's what the old
man wanted me to
learn. Sympathy.</font>

454
00:20:40,399 --> 00:20:42,982
<font color="#FFFFFF">Or empathy.
Whichever one fits.</font>

455
00:20:43,023 --> 00:20:44,232
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kids.
Kids, look.</font>

456
00:20:44,274 --> 00:20:45,523
<font color="#FFFFFF">I broke the hex.</font>

457
00:20:45,565 --> 00:20:46,898
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm getting
young again.</font>

458
00:20:46,940 --> 00:20:48,648
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's really
great, Dad.</font>

459
00:20:48,690 --> 00:20:51,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, Dad, we're
really proud of… Oh.</font>

460
00:20:51,731 --> 00:20:53,648
<font color="#FFFFFF">What? What now?</font>

461
00:20:55,940 --> 00:20:57,481
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right,
Dad, think.</font>

462
00:20:57,523 --> 00:21:01,565
<font color="#FFFFFF">What was the last interaction
you had with a black person?</font>

463
00:21:01,606 --> 00:21:05,107
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was at the T-Mobile store,
and it was not positive.</font>

464
00:21:38,315 --> 00:21:40,107
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bye! Have a beautiful time.</font>

465
00:21:41,274 --> 00:21:43,274
<font color="#FFFFFF">Captioning by Point.360</font>

